{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["That also is reckoned as the land of Rephaim — like the Rephaim given to Avraham in the Covenant Between the Pieces, where it is written: את החתי ואת הפרזי ואת הרפאים — it too is reckoned as Rephaim, and even so they fell before them and they defeated them — and all the more so you shall dispossess them." "Is reckoned — but it is not called 'the land of Rephaim' except for the kingdom of Og in Bashan, regarding which it is written just below: ההוא יקרא ארץ רפאים — that is, they are the Rephaim spoken of in the Covenant Between the Pieces, and therefore Israel shall dispossess them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:38:16.350672544Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}